Read **AGENTS.md** — it governs this repo (workflow, rules, the gate, DoD).

- Work in your own worktree; **never commit to `main`** (protected — PR + green CI).
- Before claiming success, run the repo's gate command (`npm run lint && npm test && npm run build`). Do not invent passing results.
- Smallest correct change; keep diffs small. No new dependencies without asking.
